+# PROG-04 Codex report — ask-time evaluator tagger
+
+WORKER CLAIM:
+- agent: Codex GPT-5.6 Sol
+- ticket: PROG-04 / eval-04-tagger
+- worker CLI session id: 01a00460-b63c-7492-a546-a3759f8bb9a8
+- branch/worktree: `codex/eval-04-tagger` / `/Users/vladmihaimiron/Documents/DebateAIRO-worktrees/eval-04-tagger`
+- assignment type: first_pass
+- comments read through: goal packet and its reviewer carry-forwards as supplied on 2026-08-15; board mutation prohibited
+- next action: implementation, verification, local commit, peer-review handoff
+
+## Outcome
+
+Implemented the collect-only ask-time evaluator classifier and later reconciliation path. The classifier reads the persisted raw question and current registry, re-asserts purpose-separated provider isolation before the observed vLLM call, accepts strict existing/propose/refuse decisions, routes them through deterministic admission, and writes only evaluator-owned admission, pipeline-event, and question-domain rows. Provider failure, refusal, invalid execution, and isolation collision leave the run untagged.
+
+Local commit: `c15690fd7444589352017208a166510e3e322464` (`feat(evaluator): add non-gating ask-time tagger`). No push was performed.
+
+## Reviewer carry-forwards closed
+
+1. Blank/whitespace proposals now produce a typed `REFUSED` result plus an append-only `domain_admission` receipt. Migration `0025_evaluator_domain_refusal_receipts.sql` narrows the nonblank constraint exception to `REFUSED` only. Integration proof reads the persisted blank receipt.
+2. Added and tested both missing model-output paths: explicit `REFUSED` admission and direct `SELECT_EXISTING` by `domain_id`. Successful direct selection receives a `MATCHED_EXISTING` receipt before the question link is inserted.
+3. `assertEvaluatorProviderIsolation` executes immediately before the provider-call stage. The observed-boundary test supplies a collision and proves `ProviderGateway.call` remains uncalled.
+
+## Files changed
+
+- `packages/evaluator/src/index.ts` — tagger contract, parser/prompt, typed non-gating results, pipeline receipts, existing/refusal admission paths, blank refusal receipt.
+- `apps/evaluator-worker/src/index.ts` — persisted ask-time and reconciliation entry points.
+- `migrations/0025_evaluator_domain_refusal_receipts.sql` — replay-safe refusal-only blank receipt constraints.
+- `packages/evaluator/README.md` — domain seed status and tagger/reconciliation boundary documentation.
+- `tests/unit/evaluator-tagger.test.ts` — container-up, container-down, refusal, proposal, direct selection, and isolation-boundary coverage.
+- `tests/integration/evaluator-database.test.ts` — persisted refusal/select receipts, evaluator-only landing, byte-for-byte memory no-op, down-then-reconcile flow, and existing FR-0.6 differential.
+- evaluator/evaluator-worker package manifests and `pnpm-lock.yaml` — provider type dependency.
+
+## RED → GREEN evidence
+
+RED:
+- Initial tagger unit run: all 5 new cases failed with `TypeError: runEvaluatorQuestionTagger is not a function`.
+- First full repository run: 618 passed / 1 failed; source audit rejected two unguarded `ADD CONSTRAINT` statements in migration 0025.
